"A previously exported XLIFF package is now stale. Export a fresh package "
"before importing external translations."
msgstr ""
"Prej izvoženi paket XLIFF je zastarel. Pred uvozom zunanjih prevodov "
"izvozite nov paket."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-admin.php:804
msgid ""
"A separate Media Library review asset is ready. The source image and "
"published page remain authoritative."
msgstr ""
"Na voljo je ločeno orodje za pregled medijske knjižnice. Izvorna slika in "
"objavljena stran ostaneta merodajni."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-site-plan.php:69
msgid ""
"A site translation plan needs one source locale and at least one different"
" target locale."
msgstr ""
"Načrt prevajanja spletnega mesta potrebuje eno izvorno jezikovno različico"
" in vsaj eno drugačno ciljno različico."

#: includes/class-ypm-admin-terms.php:125
msgid ""
"A supported taxonomy with management permission is required for this "
"action."
msgstr ""
"Za to dejanje potrebujete podprto taksonomijo in dovoljenje za njeno "
"upravljanje."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:815
msgid "A translation already exists for the target locale."
msgstr "Prevod za ciljno jezikovno različico že obstaja."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:832
msgid ""
"A translation appeared for the target locale while AI was working. YMulti "
"preserved the existing translation and skipped duplicate draft creation."
msgstr ""
"Med delovanjem AI je nastal prevod za ciljno jezikovno različico. YMulti "
"je ohranil obstoječi prevod in preskočil ustvarjanje podvojenega osnutka."

