#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1692
msgid ""
"AI returned a response outside the required translation JSON contract. "
"WordPress content remains unchanged; retry the translation."
msgstr ""
"AI je vrnil odgovor zunaj zahtevanega pogodbenega formata JSON za prevode."
" Vsebina WordPressa je nespremenjena; ponovite prevajanje."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1326
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty excerpt for a source item that has one. Run the draft"
" again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI je vrnil prazen povzetek za izvorni element, ki povzetek ima. Znova "
"ustvarite osnutek ali izberite drug besedilni model."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1104
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty localized term name. Run the draft again or choose "
"another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI je vrnil prazno lokalizirano ime izraza. Znova ustvarite osnutek ali "
"izberite drug besedilni model."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1137
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty string translation. Run the suggestion again or "
"choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI je vrnil prazen prevod niza. Znova ustvarite predlog ali izberite drug "
"besedilni model."

#: includes/class-ypm-ai-translation.php:1106
msgid ""
"AI returned an empty term description for a source term that has one. Run "
"the draft again or choose another text model."
msgstr ""
"AI je vrnil prazen opis izraza, čeprav ga izvorni izraz ima. Znova "
"ustvarite osnutek ali izberite drug besedilni model."

